Cactus Code Thorn IDAxiBrillBH
Authors    : Steve Brandt, Paul Walker, Ryoji Takahashi 
CVS info   : $Header$
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This thorn calculates initial data for a black hole distorted by an
even parity perturbation.

This thorn is currently an orphan (it has no active maintainer).
Jonathan Thornburg was the last person to hack on the code/documentation
a bit (in the spring-summer of 2005).
